# Copy this to ".env" in the project root. dispatcher.sh sources it every tick.
# This keeps you on your Claude SUBSCRIPTION (not API billing).
#
# NOTE for this project specifically: PATH does NOT go in this file. Expo CLI refuses to
# load any .env file that defines PATH ("Refused to load dangerous environment variables
# from .env files"), and .env is auto-scanned by every `expo`/`npx expo` command in this
# repo -- so putting PATH here breaks local Expo usage entirely. PATH lives in a separate
# file instead; copy .env.dispatcher-path.example to .env.dispatcher-path.

# 1) Generate a long-lived subscription token (uses your Pro/Max plan, NOT the API):
#       claude setup-token
#    Paste the resulting token here:
CLAUDE_CODE_OAUTH_TOKEN=sk-ant-oat01-REPLACE_ME

# 2) (Optional) GitHub edge — only needed if github.enabled is true in schedule.json.
#    Easiest is to run `gh auth login` once interactively. For pure unattended cron,
#    set a token here instead:
GH_TOKEN=ghp_REPLACE_ME_OR_USE_gh_auth_login
